  "details": "As of [VRChat 2025.4.2](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202542) `Build 1768` on 3 December 2025, `--enable-debug-gui` does nothing.\n\nThe following pages still refer to its existence or incorrectly say it to be required (a bug), but do not indicate the launch option being obsolete:\n\n- https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/launch-options\n\n- https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/keyboard-and-mouse\n\n- https://wiki.vrchat.com/wiki/Menus/en#Debug_Menus\n\nI suggest labeling the launch option as obsolete.",
